			"notes": "Madnessverse 1.0.0\n\nInitial release. Madnessverse is a Fabric/NeoForge (Architectury) port of commoble's [Infiniverse](https://github.com/commoble/infiniverse), an API for creating and removing dimensions at runtime.\n\nSupports Minecraft 1.21.1 on both Fabric and NeoForge\nMadnessverseAPI.getOrCreateLevel() / markDimensionForUnregistration() for runtime dimension management\nUnregisterDimensionEvent (Architectury event, fires identically on both loaders)\n\nSee the [README](https://github.com/lukamadness777/madnessverse#readme) for dependency setup and API usage."
		}
	],
